                    {
                        "form_id": "4d6c78f7-b4a9-4fa5-b542-de475bc5edbd",
                        "entry_id": "d9069a0c-7f1e-35a5-9d84-34efb4f55998",
                        "tags": [],
                        "form": "demidieu"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "afb0ff84-cf88-3511-8d68-bc5d212b164f",
                        "entry_id": "d9069a0c-7f1e-35a5-9d84-34efb4f55998",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Divinité de rang inférieur, être fabuleux qui est censé participer de la nature divine, comme les faunes."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "35ffd201-8136-3f6c-9136-239aa96f1b2a",
                        "entry_id": "d9069a0c-7f1e-35a5-9d84-34efb4f55998",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Homme que l’on croyait né d’un dieu et d’une mortelle, ou d’une déesse et d’un mortel."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "10435d4e-2b7f-4218-aa3d-1b187f71a850",
                                "sense_id": "35ffd201-8136-3f6c-9136-239aa96f1b2a",
                                "text": "Il n’est pas difficile de constater que cette transition du héros-dieu au héros demi-dieu, et de celui-ci au héros simplement humain, est un phénomène quasi universel supporté par la ‘hérologie’ des grands groupes ethno-culturels."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "11f7a0ee-8b45-4eb0-88dc-ea532c63f76c",
                                "sense_id": "35ffd201-8136-3f6c-9136-239aa96f1b2a",
                                "text": "L’un d’eux, un colosse barbu, était vêtu en fort de la Halle et son immense chapeau farineux lui donnait l’air d’un demi-dieu de la fable prêt à accomplir un travail héroïque."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8f6400d9-0556-4c6f-b0aa-36d9807f056e",
                        "source_entry_id": "d9069a0c-7f1e-35a5-9d84-34efb4f55998",
                        "target_lang_word": "Halbgott",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Halbgott",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "daa116e7-05eb-322f-b9c3-ee0a0c6ddaa4",
                                        "entry_id": "035914ab-c499-3d12-8569-7697ee9aa59d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "jemand mit einem göttlichen und einem nichtgöttlichen Elternteil"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09c35a7b-e1a1-403e-86a7-b2efde6549ce",
                                                "sense_id": "daa116e7-05eb-322f-b9c3-ee0a0c6ddaa4",
                                                "text": "Gwydion ist ein Zauberer aus der keltischen Mythologie und kann zu den Halbgöttern gezählt werden."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "caa7a102-bb3c-4a62-b4fa-899becb8e4ea",
                                                "sense_id": "daa116e7-05eb-322f-b9c3-ee0a0c6ddaa4",
                                                "text": "„Um sich als Halbgötter mit magischen Kräften zu geben, verstecken Stanley und seine Männer Batterien in ihren Ärmeln, die beim Händedruck Stromschläge aussenden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da10dd23-3dea-385c-b569-bfe587089075",
                                        "entry_id": "035914ab-c499-3d12-8569-7697ee9aa59d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "heldenhafter Mensch"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2680d37c-46d9-4fa8-b7ae-beda09fadfe6",
                                                "sense_id": "da10dd23-3dea-385c-b569-bfe587089075",
                                                "text": "Diego Maradona wird von manchen Leuten wie ein Halbgott verehrt."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fed584f9-b214-462b-8681-2f5111188e97",
                        "source_entry_id": "d9069a0c-7f1e-35a5-9d84-34efb4f55998",
                        "target_lang_word": "demigod",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "demigod",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d0a02be2-0bc6-3ed8-a1ba-c1ba7c473773",
                                        "entry_id": "fb0393b2-ed1b-3998-9938-2f93d9be8b97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A half-god or hero; the offspring of a deity and a mortal."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "72f47b28-798a-3108-9f4e-cf7ed099eca7",
                                        "entry_id": "fb0393b2-ed1b-3998-9938-2f93d9be8b97",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Someone held up for reverence as a supreme example."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8658b62-ca0b-4a5d-8ef4-b32c8d9f1ef3",
                                                "sense_id": "72f47b28-798a-3108-9f4e-cf7ed099eca7",
                                                "text": "\"Ah! he is one of your idols, I suppose,\" said Lord Norbourne, with a slight approach to a sneer. \"Youth is prone to admire; but it is odd how, in a few years, we discover the defects of our demigods..."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ac604f9-2429-4239-88f2-f22afa308321",
                                                "sense_id": "72f47b28-798a-3108-9f4e-cf7ed099eca7",
                                                "text": "He finds, not “demigods” but “ a combative group of exhausted, drunken, broken, petty, partisan, scheming, squabbling, bloviating, sensory-deprived, underoxygenated, fed-up, talked-out, overheated delegates so distraught they threatened violence, secession."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8f103e93-80b7-4c9d-9d97-7b9114f883e9",
                        "source_entry_id": "d9069a0c-7f1e-35a5-9d84-34efb4f55998",
                        "target_lang_word": "demi-god",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "demi-god",
